  aciklama:
  - "Tasar\u0131m\u0131m\u0131 be\u011Fenmene sevindim. Ben de senin tasar\u0131m\u0131n\u0131
    seviyorum. Hislerimiz kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131kl\u0131... <sprite=0>"
  - "Tasar\u0131m\u0131m i\xE7in \xE7ok u\u011Fra\u015F\u0131l\u0131yor. Hala katedilecek
    \xE7ok yol var. Kusursuz g\xFCzelli\u011Fi aramak b\xF6yle bir \u015Fey. <sprite=0>"
  - "Tasar\u0131m\u0131mda kullan\u0131m kolayl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n plana
    \xE7\u0131kmas\u0131na \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131ld\u0131. \u0130lerleyen zamanlarda
    \xE7ok daha i\u015Fe yarar de\u011Fi\u015Fiklikler gelebilir."
  - "Tasar\u0131m\u0131mda sofistike bir g\xFCzellik, duru bir sadeli\u011Fin i\xE7ine
    yedirilmeye \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131ld\u0131. Daha yap\u0131lacak \xE7ok i\u015F
    var... <sprite=0>"
